 explain how completeness of chain mapping and uncertainty in the critical region affect ranking; do not claim coordinate-level/interface/experimental properties that don't exist in the input.\n\nanalysis.py should read the input and produce the CSV, making it executable. I'll write analysis.py, run it to generate the CSV, and write report.md. Then I'll do a lightweight schema check (column names, row count, allowed values).\n\nCSV formatting: keep numbers as they appear in the input (global_score is tm_score as given, risk as given). E.g., 0.81, 1, 4.8. interface_score is an integer 1/0.\n\nI'll write analysis.py with the sort key exactly as specified.\n"}}
